This license covers the Hyper Tuned adapter files (the "Adapters"): the LoRA
weight files published by Uhstray for the Zerds application, their manifest
and their model cards. It does not cover the base models the Adapters are
loaded onto, which have their own licenses (see `NOTICE`).

## 1. What you may do

You may download the Adapters and run them, on your own devices, **only as
part of an application that Uhstray owns and distributes** (such as Zerds), in
the way that application uses them.

## 2. What you may not do

Unless Uhstray has agreed in writing, you may not:

1. use the Adapters in or with any application, service or product that is
   not owned and distributed by Uhstray;
2. copy, redistribute, publish, sell, rent, sublicense or host the Adapters,
   in whole or in part;
3. modify the Adapters, merge them into other model weights, or continue
   training from them;
4. use the Adapters or their outputs to train, tune or evaluate another model
   for the purpose of reproducing what the Adapters do;
5. remove this license or the notices that come with the Adapters.

## 3. Ownership

The Adapters are licensed, not sold. Uhstray keeps all rights in them that
this license does not expressly give you. Text you produce by running the
